--- !u!114 &1916616306294878971
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2510687268772921315}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: dfa19953e6e8bbb4c856435cf4657050, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DungeonBookshelf
  lore:
  - A brittle ledger lists the names of the interred. Many are crossed out twice.
  - '"Do not wake the lord beneath. He does not sleep; he waits."'
  - A child's primer. Every picture of the sun has been scratched out.
  - Accounts of the sewer works. Page after page of men lost to the dark water.
  - "A miner's journal ends mid-sentence: \"The tunnel sings back when we strike
    it, and tonight\u2014\""
  - A prayer to the Weaver, asking that the threads of the dead stay cut.
  - Recipes for preserving meat. Some of the ingredients are not meat.
  - A map of these halls, drawn by someone who clearly never found the way out.
  findChance: 0.35
  loot: {fileID: 0}
  searchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d4b34a6bc76a7fb4f91fb502589427d2, type: 3}
  searchVolume: 0.8
  seed: 0
  floorNumber: 1
  fallbackLoot: {fileID: 0}
